00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:45.640
<b>Episode 11</b>

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:45.640
<b>Kurumi Star Festival</b>

00:02:42.280 --> 00:02:45.270
<b>Huh? Kurumi, what did you just say?</b>

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:47.440
<b>My goodness, Shido-san.</b>

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:52.900
<b>Making a girl say something like that twice
 isn't very gentlemanly.</b>

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:54.770
<b>A... date?</b>

00:02:54.770 --> 00:02:58.850
<b>Yes, I would like to have some fun with you.</b>

00:02:58.850 --> 00:03:00.390
<b>Is there a problem?</b>

00:03:00.390 --> 00:03:02.160
<b>Well, it's just...</b>

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:08.130
<b>My, you don't trust me at all, do you?</b>

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:10.660
<b>But I suppose that's unavoidable.</b>

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:14.660
<b>Who would date someone 
who nearly killed them once?</b>

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:18.980
<b>But please, rest assured!</b>

00:03:18.980 --> 00:03:23.220
<b>It is in no way my intent to harm you today!</b>

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:25.600
<b>If you still don't think you can trust me,</b>

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:30.170
<b>you can put shackles on my hands or put 
a bomb around my neck! I wouldn't mind at all!</b>

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:32.600
<b>Th-That really wouldn't...</b>

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:34.280
<b>Does that mean...</b>

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:38.180
<b>you just don't want to spend time with me?</b>

00:03:39.370 --> 00:03:41.430
<b>I'm distraught!</b>

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:43.460
<b>I'm going to cry!</b>

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:48.180
<b>Hey, I never said that, did I?</b>

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:54.000
<b><i>I figured I shouldn't turn her down carelessly
 and risk triggering a disaster.</i></b>

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:56.050
<b><i>But thinking back to it now,</i></b>

00:03:56.050 --> 00:04:01.580
<b><i>I might've also been a bit intrigued by Kurumi acting out of character.</i></b>

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:04.270
<b>Fine. I'll go with you.</b>

00:04:04.270 --> 00:04:06.050
<b>Really?</b>

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:07.700
<b>I'm so happy!</b>

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:10.270
<b>You're such a kind man!</b>

00:04:11.070 --> 00:04:12.390
<b>K-Kurumi?</b>

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:15.190
<b>Isn't this a little too close?</b>

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:17.530
<b>Oh, not at all!</b>

00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:21.400
<b>After all, the two of us are on a date!</b>

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:26.800
<b>Right now, at least for this moment, you belong to me.</b>

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:31.660
<b>Or are you averse to walking arm in arm with me?</b>

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:35.300
<b>No, I wouldn't say that.</b>

00:04:36.300 --> 00:04:38.040
<b>Well then, let us make a move!</b>

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:45.910
<b>Anyway, Kurumi, where are 
we going for our date?</b>

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:48.930
<b>I had a certain place in mind.</b>

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:50.560
<b>A certain place?</b>

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:53.560
<b>I won't tell you just yet.</b>

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:04.850
<b>They look... positively delectable.</b>

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:10.470
<b>You don't mean you're still...</b>

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:15.330
<b>Don't you think they do...</b>

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:19.210
<b>those bamboo leaf castella?</b>

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:24.320
<b>Come check 'em out!</b>

