00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:29.590
<b>C-Castella?</b>

00:05:29.590 --> 00:05:33.720
<b>My, what ever did you think I was talking about?</b>

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:35.710
<b>Oh, come on.</b>

00:05:36.410 --> 00:05:39.520
<b>But they really <i>do</i> look delicious, do they not?</b>

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:43.360
<b>And look! They have lots of 
other interesting foods!</b>

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:45.560
<b>Heavenly River shaved ice!</b>

00:05:45.560 --> 00:05:49.490
<b>They poured condensed milk on Blue Hawaii 
shaved ice to make it look like the Milky Way?</b>

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:51.380
<b>Orihime cotton candy!</b>

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:54.000
<b><i>Cotton</i> candy because she weaves clothes?</b>

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:56.370
<b>That's kinda pushing it.</b>

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:58.280
<b>Kengyuu beef jerky!</b>

00:05:58.280 --> 00:06:00.750
<b>Hikoboshi's supposed to herd cows, not eat them!</b>

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:05.090
<b>It's so much fun with you around, Shido-san.</b>

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:07.220
<b>Oh, I didn't really do anything.</b>

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:09.760
<b>Now, please come this way, Shido-san.</b>

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:12.280
<b>Wai—Don't pull on my arm!</b>

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:14.530
<b>Our time is limited.</b>

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:20.020
<b>This is the place I had in mind.</b>

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:23.270
<b>Here? The planetarium?</b>

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:26.020
<b>I wasn't expecting that.</b>

00:06:26.020 --> 00:06:28.760
<b>Oh? And what exactly do you mean by that?</b>

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:30.550
<b>Oh, I, uh...</b>

00:06:30.550 --> 00:06:32.660
<b><i>I never meant to let my guard down.</i></b>

