A{*\fax-0.41}d{*\fax-0.42}u{*\fax-0.43}l{*\fax-0.44}t

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:43.860
<b><i>It attests to how much of an ordinary girl
 Kurumi was being that day.</i></b>

00:06:44.540 --> 00:06:46.590
<b><i>She happily linked arms with me,</i></b>

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:48.710
<b><i>enjoyed talking to me,</i></b>

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:50.300
<b><i>and smiled blissfully,</i></b>

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:52.940
<b><i>just like any other girl would.</i></b>

00:06:53.630 --> 00:06:56.180
<b>Shido-san, is something the matter?</b>

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:58.310
<b>No, nothing at all.</b>

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:02.290
<b><i>I still hadn't figured out her intentions.</i></b>

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:06.070
<b><i>Why did she have to approach me
 in such a roundabout way?</i></b>

00:07:11.690 --> 00:07:16.280
<b>On the bank of the Heavenly River
 lived Orihime, the Sky King's daughter.</b>

00:07:16.280 --> 00:07:18.920
<b>She was a heavenly maiden
 who wove beautiful clothes.</b>

00:07:19.950 --> 00:07:22.980
<b>However, after marrying the cow herder Hikoboshi,</b>

00:07:22.980 --> 00:07:26.170
<b>she neglected her work and fooled around every day.</b>

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:29.340
<b>Enraged, the Sky King separated the couple.</b>

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:33.590
<b>Say, Shido-san...</b>

00:07:33.590 --> 00:07:34.970
<b>Wh-What is it?</b>

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:38.530
<b>Orihime and Hikoboshi are
 kept apart by the Heavenly River,</b>

00:07:38.530 --> 00:07:42.390
<b>so they can only meet once a year, correct?</b>

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:44.360
<b>Yeah, that sounds right.</b>

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:50.480
<b>But if it rains on the seventh of July,
 they lose even that once-in-a-year chance to meet.</b>

00:07:50.480 --> 00:07:53.110
<b>Yeah, that's how the legend usually goes.</b>

00:07:53.760 --> 00:07:56.480
<b>What if, just what if...</b>

00:07:56.480 --> 00:08:03.060
<b>for years and years and years 
it rained on the seventh of July</b>

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:06.380
<b>meaning they couldn't meet for a long time.</b>

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:10.180
<b>Do you think they would be able to stay in love with each other?</b>

00:08:10.830 --> 00:08:13.010
<b>What makes you ask?</b>

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:16.260
<b>Time is the kindest thing of all.</b>

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:23.000
<b>Even the sorrow they feel losing their once-in-a-year chance to come together will eventually heal.</b>

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:25.800
<b>Time is the cruelest thing of all.</b>

00:08:25.800 --> 00:08:31.090
<b>Even though they vowed to be together forever,
 it can make even their love fade away.</b>

00:08:31.090 --> 00:08:36.050
<b>If they keep missing the only chance 
they have to connect with each other,</b>

00:08:36.050 --> 00:08:39.630
<b>how long will they remain in each others' hearts?</b>

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:45.620
<b>You're getting pretty profound there.</b>

00:08:46.570 --> 00:08:48.290
<b>Say, Kurumi...</b>

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:48.920
<b>Yes?</b>

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:52.420
<b>I'd say they'd probably never forget each other.</b>

00:08:53.350 --> 00:08:55.430
<b>What makes you think that?</b>

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:57.320
<b>Just think about it.</b>

00:08:57.320 --> 00:09:01.670
<b>They got separated because they got along 
so well that they started neglecting their jobs.</b>

00:09:01.670 --> 00:09:05.690
<b>It'll take a lot for them to forget each other.</b>

00:09:06.110 --> 00:09:08.180
<b>I see.</b>

00:09:08.180 --> 00:09:09.970
<b>Don't jump to conclusions.</b>

00:09:09.970 --> 00:09:11.570
<b>There's a reason for everything.</b>

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:15.700
<b>My theory is that they frequently meet in secret.</b>

00:09:16.960 --> 00:09:17.950
<b>Pardon?</b>

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:20.290
<b>What do you mean?</b>

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:24.310
<b>Are they not separated by the Heavenly River?</b>

00:09:24.310 --> 00:09:27.990
<b>Nah. Hikoboshi, or Kengyuu, is the star Altair.</b>

00:09:27.990 --> 00:09:29.840
<b>It's the brightest star in Aquila, the eagle!</b>

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:32.710
<b>It's easy as pie for an eagle to fly across a river.</b>

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:36.220
<b>You can bet they're meeting out of sight of the Sky King all the time!</b>

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:39.360
<b>So there's no way they'd forget each other!</b>

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:49.810
<b>Whoa, Kurumi!</b>

00:09:51.060 --> 00:09:53.360
<b>Let's go outside for now, okay?</b>

00:09:58.570 --> 00:10:00.990
<b>That was hilarious.</b>

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:02.640
<b>I see now.</b>

00:10:02.640 --> 00:10:05.240
<b>That makes complete sense.</b>

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:09.000
<b>I wasn't trying to make you laugh, but oh well.</b>

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:11.590
<b>Now that you've calmed down, 
should we go back inside?</b>

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:13.380
<b>That was enough.</b>

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:17.720
<b>Besides, I would like to try writing on a tanzaku.</b>

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:21.010
<b>They say if you write your wish on one
 and tie it to a bamboo tree,</b>

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.890
<b>then that wish will come true, right?</b>

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:26.080
<b>I can't say those paper slips actually work, though.</b>

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:27.970
<b>Tanzaku, huh?</b>

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:29.080
<b>If that's what you want to do,</b>

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:32.200
<b>there should be a huge bamboo tree on display in the shopping district.</b>

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:34.160
<b>I think they were handing out tanzaku, too.</b>

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:35.330
<b>Wanna go check it out?</b>

00:10:35.330 --> 00:10:36.150
<b>Absolutely!</b>

00:10:36.600 --> 00:10:38.210
<b>I'm looking forward to it!</b>

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:42.820
<b><i>It crossed my mind that I should
 be getting dinner ready,</i></b>

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:46.160
<b><i>but it didn't seem I'd have a chance
 to get away from Kurumi.</i></b>

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:53.400
<b><i>And I have to admit, I really didn't want to leave </i>this<i> Kurumi behind and run home.</i></b>

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:55.840
<b>What's the matter, Kurumi?</b>

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:57.550
<b>Look, Shido-san!</b>

