00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:03.960
<b>Why don't we stop by?</b>

00:11:03.960 --> 00:11:06.980
<b>I'm still in high school, though.</b>

00:11:06.980 --> 00:11:09.310
<b>Is there even a point in doing it now?</b>

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:13.190
<b>I want to make memories with you.</b>

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:18.540
<b>And I want you to have memories with me, as well.</b>

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:25.070
<b>Am I... asking too much?</b>

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:29.830
<b>F-Fine.</b>

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:33.590
<b>We can go in and ask, but if they say no, just drop it.</b>

00:11:33.590 --> 00:11:35.840
<b>Of course! I'm so happy!</b>

00:11:39.870 --> 00:11:42.720
<b>Where's Shido-san gone off to?</b>

00:11:43.630 --> 00:11:45.600
<b>You think something happened to him?</b>

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:49.850
<b>I bet he's just having a hard time
 deciding what to make for dinner.</b>

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:52.460
<b>Let's find him quickly and go home.</b>

00:11:52.460 --> 00:11:55.700
<b>Hey, Kotori. What are those people doing?</b>

00:11:56.860 --> 00:11:59.110
<b>Oh, they're hanging tanzaku.</b>

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:01.350
<b>Today's Tanabata, after all.</b>

00:12:01.350 --> 00:12:04.110
<b>Tanabata? Tanzaku?</b>

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:08.100
<b>Yeah. "Tanzaku" are slips of paper
 you write a wish on,</b>

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:12.000
<b>and if you tie it to a bamboo leaf,
 it's said that the wish will come true.</b>

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:14.000
<b>I-Incredible!</b>

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:15.190
<b>K-Kotori!</b>

00:12:15.190 --> 00:12:17.630
<b>Yeah, yeah. Feel free to write one.</b>

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:20.380
<b>Come on, Yoshino. You too.</b>

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:24.630
<b>I-I can make a wish?</b>

00:12:24.630 --> 00:12:26.260
<b>Yes, of course!</b>

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:30.520
<b>I can't promise your wish will come true, though!</b>

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:33.490
<b>Good!</b>

00:12:34.510 --> 00:12:37.020
<b>What are you two writing?</b>

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:38.860
I wish I could

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:37.110
marry Shido.

