00:12:39.580 --> 00:12:41.010
<b>What's wrong, Kotori?</b>

00:12:41.010 --> 00:12:42.520
<b>I-It's no big deal.</b>

00:12:42.520 --> 00:12:43.940
<b>I just misspelled something.</b>

00:12:43.940 --> 00:12:46.680
<b>Aren't you writing something different?</b>

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:49.430
<b>Y-You just saw it wrong! Totally wrong!</b>

00:12:49.430 --> 00:12:51.720
<b>Are you done writing yours, Yoshino?</b>

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:54.500
<b>Let's hang these up right away and go find Shido!</b>

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:56.930
<b>O-Okay.</b>

00:13:12.590 --> 00:13:15.680
<b>It's gonna be hard finding him in a crowd this big.</b>

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:17.400
<b>Oh, well.</b>

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:19.220
<b>Let's split up for now.</b>

00:13:19.220 --> 00:13:20.740
<b>I'll look over there.</b>

00:13:20.740 --> 00:13:22.100
<b>Tohka, you look over there.</b>

00:13:22.100 --> 00:13:25.140
<b>Yoshino and Yoshinon, can you look around there?</b>

00:13:25.140 --> 00:13:26.780
<b>Roger that!</b>

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:33.790
<b>I hope Shido-san didn't get in trouble.</b>

00:13:35.260 --> 00:13:39.290
<b>He might have, but I have an idea
 of what actually happened.</b>

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:40.420
<b>What?</b>

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:42.670
<b>A girl! He's with a girl!</b>

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:44.800
<b>Shido-kun, you dog!</b>

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:47.870
<b>No way. Shido-san would never—</b>

00:13:51.020 --> 00:13:52.680
<b>Th-That's...</b>

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:54.930
<b>It's Shido-kun!</b>

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:57.190
<b>He's picked up a real hottie!</b>

00:13:57.190 --> 00:13:58.240
<b>What a player!</b>

00:13:58.240 --> 00:14:00.000
<b>I-I can't believe it!</b>

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:08.530
<b>Wedding?</b>

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:10.070
<b>Oh boy!</b>

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:19.420
<b>Shido-san, what are you doing?</b>

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:20.920
<b>Oh?</b>

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:25.090
<b>Hello, there. Can I help you?</b>

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:31.590
<b>U-Um...</b>

00:14:31.590 --> 00:14:34.180
<b>What are you to Shido-san?</b>

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:36.890
<b>Are you an acquaintance of Shido-san?</b>

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:38.480
<b>Oh?</b>

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:41.230
<b>I think I've seen you before.</b>

00:14:45.770 --> 00:14:46.560
<b>Um...</b>

00:14:46.560 --> 00:14:49.380
<b>Oh, please, pay me no mind.</b>

00:14:49.380 --> 00:14:54.070
<b>Anyway, you wanted to know about my relationship with Shido-san?</b>

00:14:54.070 --> 00:14:55.590
<b>Y-Yes!</b>

00:14:55.590 --> 00:14:57.330
<b>It's a good question.</b>

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:59.000
<b>What would be the best way of putting it?</b>

00:14:59.600 --> 00:15:02.230
<b>You could say that we are bound together by fate</b>

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:04.690
<b>or that we are simply inseparable.</b>

00:15:04.690 --> 00:15:09.760
<b>We're in a very deep, very special relationship,
 so none can come between us.</b>

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:11.260
<b>Wh-What?</b>

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:15.260
<b>I know every nook and cranny of Shido-san's body.</b>

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:19.270
<b>I've examined it as carefully as if I were licking his entire body.</b>

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:24.450
<b>We spent an especially hot night 
together when we met last month.</b>

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:30.260
<b>I was talking with Shido-san when a hot object was suddenly inserted into me.</b>

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:35.680
<b>He will have to take responsibility for that.</b>

00:15:35.680 --> 00:15:36.530
<b>Wh-What?!</b>

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:38.230
<b>Oh, yes.</b>

00:15:38.230 --> 00:15:43.920
<b>And right now I'm wearing lingerie that Shido-san personally selected for me.</b>

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:46.800
<b>Would you like to take a look?</b>

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:53.670
<b>Have a nice day.</b>

