<b>I{*\fax0.246}t{*\fax0.242}s{*\fax0.238}u{*\fax0.235}k{*\fax0.231}a {*\fax0.223}K{*\fax0.219}o{*\fax0.215}t{*\fax0.212}o{*\fax0.208}r{*\fax0.204}i</b>

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:36.090
<b>I{*\fax0.302}n{*\fax0.305}c{*\fax0.307}o{*\fax0.309}m{*\fax0.312}i{*\fax0.314}n{*\fax0.316}g {*\fax0.321}C{*\fax0.323}a{*\fax0.325}l{*\fax0.328}l</b>

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:39.600
<b>Go ahead!</b>

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:01.750
<b>It's embarrassing when you stare so much.</b>

00:17:07.400 --> 00:17:09.600
<b>Oh, sorry about that.</b>

00:17:09.600 --> 00:17:13.260
<b>It's just... you look so beautiful.</b>

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:15.630
<b>My, I'm so happy to hear that.</b>

00:17:17.990 --> 00:17:21.960
<b>Say, Kurumi, what did you tell her?</b>

00:17:21.960 --> 00:17:25.020
<b>I didn't say much at all.</b>

00:17:25.530 --> 00:17:30.150
<b>"I have an incurable disease with only so many days left to live."</b>

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:35.780
<b>"It's unlikely I will live until he reaches
 an age when we can be wed."</b>

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:40.580
<b>"So he took pity on me and brought me here so I could at least try on a wedding dress."</b>

00:17:41.280 --> 00:17:45.540
<b>When I told her that, she immediately made all the arrangements.</b>

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:48.960
<b>Oh, come on. That was a complete lie.</b>

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:51.860
<b>I suppose so.</b>

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:59.800
<b>Now, if you'd like, I can give you a free photoshoot in the chapel!</b>

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:03.220
<b>Oh, no. That's not necessary.</b>

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:04.930
<b>How can you say that?</b>

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:06.170
<b>This...</b>

00:18:06.170 --> 00:18:08.920
<b>This might be your last chance!</b>

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:11.810
<b>Why not take her up on the offer, Shido-san?</b>

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:16.570
<b>I <i>would</i> like to have a photo taken with you.</b>

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:21.570
<b>Okay, please stand in front of the altar!</b>

00:18:21.570 --> 00:18:23.200
<b>All right, here it goes!</b>

00:18:24.560 --> 00:18:26.940
<b>Come on. Get a bit closer!</b>

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:30.980
<b>And the groom needs to put on a bigger smile!</b>

00:18:35.690 --> 00:18:36.790
<b>Say cheese!</b>

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:44.100
<b>Shido's with a woman who rolls up her skirt?</b>

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:45.720
<b>Y-Yes!</b>

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:47.480
<b>Tohka! Yoshino!</b>

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:50.370
<b>How'd it go? Did you find Shido?</b>

00:18:50.370 --> 00:18:52.040
<b>Oh, Kotori!</b>

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:54.900
<b>Actually, Yoshino <i>did</i> say she saw Shido.</b>

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:56.840
<b>Really? Where is he?</b>

00:18:56.840 --> 00:18:58.990
<b>Well, before we get to that...</b>

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:03.120
<b>Apparently, having spent a hot night
 with a cute girl after rolling up her skirt,</b>

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:05.740
<b>Shido is taking responsibility by 
getting "married," whatever that is.</b>

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:06.580
<b>Huh?</b>

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:11.750
<b>What the hell?!</b>

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:13.730
<b>Sh-Shido's getting married?!</b>

00:19:13.730 --> 00:19:15.610
<b>H-How did that happen?!</b>

00:19:15.610 --> 00:19:18.130
<b>I don't know the details.</b>

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:19.970
<b>You've gotta be kidding me!</b>

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:25.390
<b>Who's this nobody who's tricked my big brother?!</b>

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:28.060
<b>Take me there!</b>

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:29.270
<b>O-Okay!</b>

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:32.670
<b><i>I was getting even more confused.</i></b>

00:19:32.670 --> 00:19:35.150
<b><i>Kurumi is the worst of the Spirits,</i></b>

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:37.940
<b><i>with whom the highest degree of caution is required.</i></b>

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:41.150
<b><i>But at this moment, Kurumi was...</i></b>

00:19:43.180 --> 00:19:44.160
<b>Shido-san.</b>

00:19:44.520 --> 00:19:46.080
<b>Look at that!</b>

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:52.480
<b>How pretty they are!</b>

00:19:52.480 --> 00:19:53.920
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:57.080
<b>They're handing out tanzaku over there.</b>

00:19:57.080 --> 00:19:58.550
<b>Why don't you go write one?</b>

00:19:58.550 --> 00:20:01.800
<b>Yes, I'll do just that.</b>

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:04.340
<b>Won't you be writing one?</b>

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:05.780
<b>Oh, I'm okay.</b>

00:20:06.630 --> 00:20:09.680
<b>As we're on a date,
 why don't we write them together?</b>

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:18.160
<b><i>My wish, huh?</i></b>

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:20.660
<b><i>It's tough to actually come up with one.</i></b>

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:23.950
<b><i>I want to have pork cutlet curry for dinner tonight!</i></b>

