00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:01.360
<b>What did you write, Kurumi?</b>

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:07.110
<b>Shido-san, you shouldn't pry into a girl's secrets.</b>

00:21:09.900 --> 00:21:11.860
<b>That was a cute reaction.</b>

00:21:11.860 --> 00:21:13.750
<b>S-Stop teasing me!</b>

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:15.320
<b>Well, whatever.</b>

00:21:15.320 --> 00:21:18.120
<b>If you're done, let's go hang them on a bamboo tree.</b>

00:21:18.120 --> 00:21:21.500
<b>Sure. Which one should we use?</b>

00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:26.130
<b>They say your wish is more likely to be granted if it's hung closer to the sky.</b>

00:21:26.130 --> 00:21:28.760
<b>Up there, then?</b>

00:21:29.770 --> 00:21:32.020
<b>That certainly is high up.</b>

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:35.070
<b>But it'll be too dangerous.</b>

00:21:35.070 --> 00:21:38.950
<b>There's another tree on the other side. 
Let's go check that out.</b>

00:21:38.950 --> 00:21:41.400
<b>Okay, that's fine with me.</b>

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:46.520
<b>There we go.</b>

00:21:46.520 --> 00:21:47.910
<b>Let's hang yours, Kurumi.</b>

00:21:51.190 --> 00:21:53.520
<b>Kurumi? What's wrong?</b>

00:21:53.520 --> 00:21:57.410
<b>Shido-san, earlier you were saying</b>

00:21:57.410 --> 00:22:04.170
<b>Orihime and Hikoboshi wouldn't forget each other
 even if it kept raining for years.</b>

00:22:04.170 --> 00:22:06.420
<b>Yeah, I did.</b>

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:08.420
<b>Say, Shido-san,</b>

00:22:08.420 --> 00:22:15.040
<b>if it were to rain for many years, would you still not forget me?</b>

00:22:15.040 --> 00:22:15.680
<b>Huh?</b>

00:22:29.440 --> 00:22:32.150
<b>Yeah, I won't forget you.</b>

00:22:32.150 --> 00:22:35.060
<b>I mean, how could I?</b>

00:22:35.060 --> 00:22:38.080
<b>You're too intense of a girl for me to forget.</b>

00:22:40.960 --> 00:22:42.710
<b>Good to know.</b>

00:22:42.710 --> 00:22:45.030
<b>What was that all about?</b>

00:22:45.030 --> 00:22:47.920
<b>Anyway, aren't you going to hang your tanzaku?</b>

00:22:47.920 --> 00:22:51.320
<b>If you don't want me to see it, I can go over there.</b>

00:22:51.320 --> 00:22:52.470
<b>No.</b>

00:22:53.070 --> 00:22:56.350
<b>It seems I've run out of time.</b>

00:22:57.220 --> 00:23:00.600
<b>I've finally found you, <i>me</i>.</b>

00:23:00.600 --> 00:23:04.610
<b>It looks like you've roamed around a lot on your own.</b>

00:23:04.940 --> 00:23:07.230
<b>But that all ends now.</b>

00:23:07.230 --> 00:23:10.740
<b>A clone who doesn't obey my will</b>

00:23:10.740 --> 00:23:13.490
<b>is nothing more than a nuisance.</b>

00:23:15.280 --> 00:23:17.240
<b>A clone?</b>

00:23:20.830 --> 00:23:24.080
<b>Long time no see, Shido-san.</b>

00:23:24.750 --> 00:23:27.160
<b>My sincerest apologies.</b>

00:23:27.160 --> 00:23:31.010
<b>My failed clone must have been quite the bother.</b>

00:23:31.800 --> 00:23:33.510
<b>What's going on here?</b>

00:23:33.510 --> 00:23:36.560
<b>I believe I told you once before.</b>

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:41.770
<b>My clones are my past; they are my history.</b>

00:23:42.140 --> 00:23:45.020
<b>The Tokisaki Kurumi over there is no exception.</b>

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:49.530
<b>She's a false personality derived
 from a single moment in my life.</b>

00:23:49.530 --> 00:23:53.410
<b>However, it was the worst possible moment.</b>

00:23:54.090 --> 00:23:56.400
<b>It's as if a god were playing tricks on me.</b>

00:23:56.400 --> 00:24:05.170
<b>That me is the clone who talked to you on the rooftop of the high school last month that was mistakenly regenerated.</b>

00:24:10.880 --> 00:24:14.050
<b>You're the Kurumi from back then?</b>

00:24:20.810 --> 00:24:28.280
<b>Unfortunately, I can't spare a clone who doesn't follow my orders.</b>

00:24:28.820 --> 00:24:32.570
<b>Especially if it's the me who was
 moved by your kindness.</b>

00:24:37.910 --> 00:24:39.160
<b>Kurumi!</b>

00:24:39.600 --> 00:24:43.410
<b>Shido-san, I had fun today.</b>

00:24:43.410 --> 00:24:44.970
<b>Thank you.</b>

00:24:48.240 --> 00:24:49.360
<b>Kurumi...</b>

00:24:52.000 --> 00:24:58.050
<b>Killing a me I've already killed once before
 isn't a particularly pleasant feeling.</b>

00:24:58.050 --> 00:25:00.720
<b>I am done here for today.</b>

00:25:00.720 --> 00:25:05.110
<b>As much as I would love to talk with you more...</b>

00:25:05.110 --> 00:25:06.060
<b>Shido!</b>

00:25:06.960 --> 00:25:08.060
<b>Step back!</b>

00:25:08.060 --> 00:25:10.320
<b>Tohka, Kotori, Yoshino...</b>

00:25:10.320 --> 00:25:11.570
<b>Kurumi?</b>

00:25:12.190 --> 00:25:14.580
<b>I won't let you lay a finger on Shido!</b>

00:25:14.580 --> 00:25:17.220
<b>You never learn, do you?</b>

00:25:17.220 --> 00:25:18.700
<b>What is it this time?</b>

00:25:18.700 --> 00:25:23.300
<b>If you surrender peacefully, we'll hear you out.</b>

00:25:24.290 --> 00:25:30.960
<b>Since a very scary flame Spirit is here,
 I'll be withdrawing for the day.</b>

00:25:31.340 --> 00:25:33.840
<b>Have a nice day, Shido-san.</b>

00:25:40.010 --> 00:25:42.190
<b>Shido, are you all right?</b>

00:25:42.190 --> 00:25:44.220
<b>Yeah, I'm all right.</b>

00:25:45.930 --> 00:25:47.230
<b>Kurumi!</b>

00:25:48.110 --> 00:25:50.610
<b><i>That Kurumi knew.</i></b>

00:25:50.610 --> 00:25:56.490
<b><i>She knew full well that the real Kurumi would kill her again, and she still came to see me.</i></b>

00:25:56.490 --> 00:26:02.500
<b><i>For just a few hours of memories,
 she defied the absolute orders from herself.</i></b>

00:26:03.990 --> 00:26:05.460
<b>Shido?</b>

00:26:07.500 --> 00:26:09.630
<b>Shido, what are those?</b>

00:26:24.640 --> 00:26:26.770
<b>Shido, where are you going?!</b>

00:26:38.990 --> 00:26:40.030
<b>Shido!</b>

00:26:41.070 --> 00:26:41.910
<b>He's up there!</b>

00:26:41.910 --> 00:26:43.090
<b>Shido!</b>

00:26:54.170 --> 00:26:54.920
<b>Shido!</b>

00:26:59.840 --> 00:27:01.430
<b>Are you okay, Shido?</b>

00:27:02.720 --> 00:27:05.180
<b>Yeah. Thanks for saving me, Tohka.</b>

00:27:07.310 --> 00:27:08.680
<b>What are you playing at?</b>

00:27:08.680 --> 00:27:12.230
<b>Why'd you put a tanzaku up that high?</b>

00:27:12.230 --> 00:27:14.340
<b>That was dangerous.</b>

00:27:14.340 --> 00:27:16.340
<b>You sure got people's attention, though!</b>

00:27:17.230 --> 00:27:17.940
<b>Sorry.</b>

00:27:19.200 --> 00:27:23.450
<b>But that's one wish that really needs to come true.</b>

